    "updated_at": "2018-03-07T06:34:31Z",
    "body": "Per https://searchfox.org/mozilla-central/source/dom/webidl/OffscreenCanvas.webidl it seems Gecko doesn't have [EnforceRange] and also uses unsigned long rather than unsigned long long.\r\n\r\nhttps://cs.chromium.org/chromium/src/third_party/WebKit/Source/core/offscreencanvas/OffscreenCanvas.idl?q=OffscreenCanvas.idl&sq=package:chromium&l=1 also doesn't use long long, just long (they do have [EnforceRange]). It seems it might have to be specified before \"attribute\".",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/371038168/reactions",
